{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Forgotten Mine",
    "steam_appid": 3637450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fallen deep into a forgotten mine, you take control of a stranded miner in this atmospheric 2D platformer. Explore dark tunnels, jump across perilous gaps, and use your pickaxe to break through obstacles and fend off dangerous creatures like bats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your abilities, uncover secrets, and find a way back to the surface\u2014before the mine becomes your tomb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were walking with your friend Bob when, without warning, the ground beneath you gave way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/834bc9b4730e62c9a6332fcdce9e18fa.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both of you plunged into an abandoned mine. When you woke up, Bob was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find him \u2014 and a way out \u2014 you set off into the depths of the mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/3f13d9183e1b688a9a064c12b7b3feb2.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, you spot something in the darkness... You're not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/446e6d36263592c841e8d00ece2cf8eb.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you reach a collapsed tunnel, blocked by rocks. Searching the area, you discover a pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/1ce1ee2cb39f607f3300d53e3742c5a9.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of the pickaxe in hand, you can now break through obstacles and venture deeper into the mine, uncovering clues about what happened to Bob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/f60309fa23182eab98722e18495e8606.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find him \u2014 and make it out alive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fallen deep into a forgotten mine, you take control of a stranded miner in this atmospheric 2D platformer. Explore dark tunnels, jump across perilous gaps, and use your pickaxe to break through obstacles and fend off dangerous creatures like bats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your abilities, uncover secrets, and find a way back to the surface\u2014before the mine becomes your tomb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were walking with your friend Bob when, without warning, the ground beneath you gave way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/834bc9b4730e62c9a6332fcdce9e18fa.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both of you plunged into an abandoned mine. When you woke up, Bob was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find him \u2014 and a way out \u2014 you set off into the depths of the mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/3f13d9183e1b688a9a064c12b7b3feb2.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, you spot something in the darkness... You're not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/446e6d36263592c841e8d00ece2cf8eb.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you reach a collapsed tunnel, blocked by rocks. Searching the area, you discover a pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/1ce1ee2cb39f607f3300d53e3742c5a9.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of the pickaxe in hand, you can now break through obstacles and venture deeper into the mine, uncovering clues about what happened to Bob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/f60309fa23182eab98722e18495e8606.avif?t=1750096823\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find him \u2014 and make it out alive?</p>",
    "short_description": "The Forgotten Mine is a small 2D Platformer, from a young small Team.In this Platformer you fell into a mine where nobody was for years. You had a friend with you, but since you woke up the friend is gone. So you're going to search for your friend and for an exit of the mine",
